atom	conceive_mind_indep	you can conceive it possible the objects of your thought may exist without the mind
atom	framing_ideas	imagining them is only framing in your mind ideas you call books and trees while omitting to frame the idea of anyone who may perceive them
atom	perceive_while	you yourself perceive or think of them all the while
atom	conceive_unconceived	you conceive them existing unconceived or unthought of
atom	repugnant	conceiving them existing unconceived or unthought of is a manifest repugnancy
atom	own_ideas	when we do our utmost to conceive the existence of external bodies, we are only contemplating our own ideas
